        <p>
          The 12-month plan includes a premium player app worth £9.99, which removes the sideloading step
          entirely for anyone who would rather not do it. There is a <strong>7-day money-back window</strong>
          on every plan, which exists mostly for one scenario: the customer's line turns out to be under
