          <a href="/blog/iptv-uk/">IPTV UK guide</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 id="not-for-you">When not to bother with any of this</h2>
        <p>
          The section the forty-one-item lists will never write, because there is no commission in it.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Your peak-time speed on the stick is under 15 Mbps.</strong> Fix the line first. This is the single most common reason our refund window gets used, and we would rather tell you now than take £{site.price} and hand it back in six days</li>
