        <p>
          IPTV on a Firestick is a fifteen-minute job and the stick you already own is probably fine. The
          part worth spending your attention on is not which app you install — it is the thirty seconds
          it takes to plug in the HDMI extender and the two minutes it takes to move onto the 5 GHz band.
          Those two do more for picture stability than any decision you will make about software.
        </p>
